David, miss you and Sue,

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.680
we miss you a lot.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.648
We're gonna see you
in a couple weeks,

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.916
but actually-
- That's right.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.551
- Actually that is
the perfect place

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.519
