00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.781
And when you should
know it's time to go.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.150
I obviously felt
it was time to go.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.586
You have a little, you know,

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.020 align:start size:88% position:13%
