people I truly love.

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.467
I speak at the synagogue.

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:24.971
I'm sort of, again,
the unofficial rabbi.

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.841
And, of course, other people,
I've been here for 40 years.

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.945
It's a long time. You
make a lot of friends.

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:35.114 align:start size:88% position:13%
But I'm not here because
of the fight issue.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:37.050
If you want to fight,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.285 align:start size:84% position:16%
