California to Florida.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.991
And I wish everybody did fight.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:48.194
But specifically with
regard to California,

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:49.896
I'm here because of people.

00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:54.601 align:start position:0%
By the way, if a lot of the
conservatives of California move

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.835
