00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.359
That's sick.

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.527
- Well, I can tell you
from being here just

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:22.996
for a couple weeks,

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:24.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've mentioned this on
the show almost every day,

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:25.531
the people that I'm meeting here

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.367
who are the new refugees here,

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:29.535 align:start size:88% position:13%
they know what they
fled and why they fled.

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:30.603
So I'm very hopeful.

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:31.771
- That's right.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:33.306 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I'm very, very
hopeful on that front.

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.741 align:start size:81% position:19%
But, all right,
what do you think?

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.242
Let's go with that
for a little bit.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.811
What do you think really
is the future of America,

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:41.748
