aligned with us.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:58.731
What is the united bond of
the United States of America,

00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:00.767
if this continues
in this direction?

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.202
Which to me, it has to
actually at this point.

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:09.809 align:start position:0%
- For all intents and purposes,
there are two Americas.

00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:11.778 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think Americans
are more divided now

