00:09:47.787 --> 00:09:52.224 align:start size:84% position:16%
Look, I know as
much as most rabbis.

00:09:52.224 --> 00:09:54.894
I know more than some rabbis.

00:09:56.295 --> 00:10:01.067 align:start size:97% position:3%
My biblical Hebrew is superb
